# Recall Mobile (Expo)

~50k TS/TSX excluding tests. Screens: chat, memory, todos, Learning (`projects/`), settings. History/search = drawer.

- Functional components + hooks only
- Network calls only through `lib/api.ts` (barrel over `lib/api/*.ts`) — never call LLM providers from mobile
- Chat logic in `hooks/useChat*.ts`; fences in `lib/fenceRegistry.ts` + `components/rich/`
- Use product model aliases, never provider names
- Google Sign-In requires dev build; Expo Go uses dev auth placeholder
- Physical device: `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` must be Mac LAN IP, not localhost
